# Frontend build-time configuration.
#
# Leave UNSET for local dev and Docker — the app falls back to the relative
# "/api" path, which Vite (dev) and nginx (Docker) proxy to the backend.
#
# Set this ONLY when the frontend is deployed separately from the backend
# (e.g. Vercel frontend + Render/Railway backend). Copy to .env and fill in:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-url.example.com/api
